# fifo_stamp_ring_full: The pending ring holds 128 stamps. Behind a faulted head, 127 NOPs complete unpublished; the 129th command is read and advanced (0x100c counts it) and then blocks pushing its stamp, so the FIFO reads no further. 0x1024 publishes the 128 in one interrupt, which frees the ring: the blocked command and the one after it then publish one interrupt each.
